    <p>Adrián Hernández is a music producer, sound designer, creative director and graphic designer based in Madrid.</p>
    <p>As a producer and sound designer, his work sits at the intersection of computer music, internet culture and sonic storytelling, spanning electronic and avant-garde production under his alias Joven Promesa Main Serenata, as well as sound design and music for visual media and commercial projects.</p>
    <p>As a creative director and graphic designer, he develops visual identities, art direction and graphic design for artists and brands, with an intuitive sense of composition and a fluency in digital pop culture.</p>
    <p>Across sound and image, his practice is shaped by a contemporary, digital edge.</p>
